            <div xml:id="d337-a1">

                <pb facs="d337-12" n="12" sameAs="frus:frus1961-63v07-09mSupp/d337-12"/>


                <p>Mr. McGeorge Bundy</p>
                <p>The White House</p>
                <p>The Secretary asked me to send you the attached unsigned memorandum from him to
                    the President on the military aspects of the balance <pb facs="1634" n="1483"
                        type="typeset" xml:id="pg1483"/> of payments drain. This is the question
                    which the Secretary plans to discuss with the President and Secretary McNamara tomorrow afternoon from 4:00 to
                    5:00.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>Benjamin H. Read </signed><affiliation>Executive Secretary</affiliation>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
